              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• Doubt hes available but if Coker is hanging around in a full PPR 2WR/2Flex or 3WR/1Flex setup, be aggressive. Hell be a flex play moving forward",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
