    {
      "cells": [
        {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "5-25% - Pat Bryant",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• UPDATE: Moving Pat Bryant up, was probably underrating his upside. Cant start him this week (due to sub-60% route share) but looks live to be the 2nd best option in this offense.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Would be aggressive in deep leagues. Will be someone Im being aggressive on in my 20 round FFPC/NFFC style leagues.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Year 2 upside, 3rd in routes run but led all DEN WRs in target share. Think he could flip Sutton in a good offense (better days ahead)",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Downside this is Troy Franklin and he never sustains 85%+ of the routes (roughly the threshold to start him comfortably) but I believe in his talent moreso",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cells": [
        {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "5-20% - Devaughn Vele",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• Vele is a flex play as long as Tyson is out. Fun offense that plays dome games. Lots of plays/pass attempts.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Year 3 breakout at 28 years old?",
              "bold": false,
