    },
    {
      "cells": [
        {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "3-15% - Caleb Douglas",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• Rookie Upside!",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Full time WR, crushed everything on a per route basis, 7-5-94 with a 24% target share is super encouraging.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• 2 MTFs on 5 catches is nice too",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Malik Willis at QB is the only limiting factor (15/27, 220, 0/1)",
