    {
      "cells": [
        {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "1-10% - Antonio Williams",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• Caleb Douglas and Antonio Williams are your true diamonds in the rough from week 1",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Williams turned just 11 routes into 4-64-1, 4 1sts Downs, 158.3 passer rating when targeted",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• His production felt back weighted especially once Okonkwo got hurt. A little buried behind Diggs/Mclaurin but room to jump Dyami Brown who had 61% of the routes. Diggs a part time player with 66% of the routes. So absolutely a path for him to get the routes needed to make a difference",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Strong stash",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            }
